cff-version: 1.2.0
title: blade-root-insert-debond
message: 若本仓库对你的工作有帮助，请按下列方式引用。
type: software
abstract: >-
  风电叶片叶根预埋螺套界面脱粘的有限元仿真，以及用分布式光纤在叶根内表面
  检出该脱粘的正演模型。含轴对称分层内聚力模型与三维分层扇形块模型两套，
  几何由配置文件给出，随仓库发布的是一套代表性算例参数。
  Finite-element simulation of adhesive debonding at the embedded insert
  interface in a wind turbine blade root, with a forward model for
  distributed fibre-optic detection on the root inner surface.
authors:
  - name: 北京雅德士工程技术咨询服务有限公司
    alias: ARCWIND
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - wind turbine blade
  - blade root
  - embedded insert
  - cohesive zone model
  - debonding
  - distributed fibre optic sensing
  - structural health monitoring
